+  <> "</p>"
+  <> "<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;\">"
+  <> "<li style=\""
+  <> item_style
+  <> "\">A written reference from your current or previous landlord (a photo, scan or PDF is fine). First time renting? A character reference from someone who knows you works instead.</li>"
+  <> "<li style=\""
+  <> item_style
+  <> "\">A written reference from your employer, if you're employed or self-employed.</li>"
+  <> "<li style=\""
+  <> item_style
