+/// Handler, mixed pool: one stage-1 and one stage-2 recipient in a single
+/// click → 200 with per-stage counts. Only the synchronous response is
+/// asserted — the stamped rows are pinned by the SQL-level tests, and the
+/// background sends run against an empty Resend key (their self-healing
+/// clear must not flake this test).
+pub fn remind_mixed_pool_reports_per_stage_counts_test() {
